<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-06-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	   C/S =  3.82 %		    C/S =  Par</p>
<p>	   O/N =  0.64 %		    O/N =  Par</p>
<p>	   T/N =  1.27 %		    T/N =  Par</p>
<p>		   June 20, 1997		     June 19, 1997</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  2.72 %     1 month forward =  2.04 %</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  3.06 %     2 month forward =  2.88 %</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  3.17 %     3 month forward =  3.17 %</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  3.74 %     4 month forward =  3.65 %</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  3.94 %     5 month forward =  3.94 %</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  4.07 %     6 month forward =  4.07 %</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
